---
import InfoCard from "../InfoCard.astro";
import CtaButton from "../CtaButton.astro";
---

<article class="relative border-2 border-charcoal p-5 md:p-8" style="box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #2b2b2b;">

  <!-- Recap eyebrow -->
  <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
    <span class="font-mono font-black text-charcoal text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase bg-mustard border-2 border-charcoal px-3 py-1 -rotate-2">★ The Recap ★</span>
    <span class="font-mono font-bold text-charcoal/60 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">Sunday, May 24</span>
  </div>

  <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl text-charcoal font-display mb-6">
    <span class="decoration-4 decoration-mustard underline underline-offset-4 md:underline-offset-10">The Debut Session:<br class="sm:hidden" /> Live Jazz</span>
  </h2>
  <p class="text-charcoal text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
    Our very first session, and what a way to start. Blankets on the floor, little feet finding the beat, and an hour of live jazz filling the room. No shushing, no stiff seats — just our little locals soaking up their first live show. Here's a peek at the magic. 🎷
  </p>

  <!-- Video -->
  <figure class="mb-8">
    <div class="border-2 border-charcoal bg-charcoal overflow-hidden" style="box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #2b2b2b;">
      <video
        controls
        playsinline
        preload="metadata"
        poster="/videos/neonnotes-jazz-debut-poster.jpg"
        class="w-full h-auto block max-h-[70vh] mx-auto"
      >
        <source src="/videos/neonnotes-jazz-debut.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        Your browser can't play this video — but trust us, it was a good one.
      </video>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="font-mono font-bold text-charcoal/60 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mt-3 text-center">
      ♪ Moments from our debut — Millennium Dance Complex, Las Vegas
    </figcaption>
  </figure>

  <!-- By the numbers -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-8">

    <InfoCard bg="bg-mustard" label="The Set" class="items-center text-center">
      <p class="font-display text-4xl text-charcoal leading-none">60</p>
      <p class="text-charcoal text-xs font-semibold leading-snug">minutes of live jazz</p>
    </InfoCard>

    <InfoCard bg="bg-coral" label="Dance Floor" class="items-center text-center">
      <p class="font-display text-4xl text-charcoal leading-none">100%</p>
      <p class="text-charcoal text-xs font-semibold leading-snug">open for wiggles</p>
    </InfoCard>

    <InfoCard bg="bg-seafoam" label="Shushing" class="items-center text-center">
      <p class="font-display text-4xl text-charcoal leading-none">0</p>
      <p class="text-charcoal text-xs font-semibold leading-snug">times, not once</p>
    </InfoCard>

    <InfoCard bg="bg-charcoal" tone="dark" label="Little Locals" class="items-center text-center">
      <p class="font-display text-4xl text-mustard leading-none">∞</p>
      <p class="text-sand text-xs font-light leading-snug">memories made</p>
    </InfoCard>

  </div>

  <!-- Closing note -->
  <div class="bg-charcoal border-2 border-mustard p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-5" style="box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #2b2b2b;">
    <p class="text-sand text-base leading-relaxed flex-1">
      <span class="text-mustard font-black">Thank you for dancing with us.</span> This was just the first note — the next session is already in the works.
    </p>
    <div class="shrink-0">
      <CtaButton size="lg">See What's Next</CtaButton>
    </div>
  </div>

</article>
